sshkeys_core-2.5.0/lib/puppet/...   the release openvox 8.34.0 vendors
sshkeys_core-3.1.0/lib/puppet/...   the release SIMP pins; differs from 2.5.0 only
                                    in puppet/type/sshkey.rb and
                                    puppet/type/ssh_authorized_key.rb
Each holds puppet/type/sshkey.rb, puppet/provider/sshkey/parsed.rb,
puppet/type/ssh_authorized_key.rb and puppet/provider/ssh_authorized_key/parsed.rb.

Do not edit: TestFixturesMatchManifest requires each file's sha256 to equal the
digest in ../manifest.go.
